的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_SUITABLE_FOR_ALL"],"多人聚餐/單人用餐皆宜",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3YcHCGgoAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3IcHCGcoBw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"這裡的停車情況如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_SOMEWHAT_DIFFICULT_TO_FIND"],"停車位有點難找",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3YcHCGooAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3IcHCGkoCA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_LOT"],"付費停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3YcHCGwoAA"],[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_GARAGE"],"付費室內停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3YcHCG0oAQ"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3IcHCGsoCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3YcHCG8oAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjw1unG8tSWAxWGj68BHV_eHBgQ3IcHCG4oCg",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這次品嚐的這碗拉麵，整體來說湯頭算是亮點之一，濃郁順滑，入口時能感受到豚骨特有的厚實香氣，味道也不會過鹹。麵體部分可以依照個人口感向店家調整軟硬度，這點相當友善；基本配料則是叉燒、黑木耳與青蔥，桌上還提供七味粉、現磨芝麻與黑胡椒兩種調味料，以及豆芽與酸菜兩樣鹹菜可以搭配。\n\n但談到叉燒，我真心覺得不行，入口有明顯的肉騷味，完全蓋過湯頭的美好。再來，雖然每家店的配料配置不同，但以 250 元的價格，只有黑木耳與蔥花，份量與誠意感覺稍微不足（純個人感受）。\n\n不過，店內用餐環境乾淨整潔，服務人員介紹餐點也算用心，整體氛圍是舒服的。\n只是，食物好不好吃、值不值得再訪，本來就是很主觀的事情。\n以我個人的主觀感受來說，這碗拉麵我應該不會再來第二次了。",null,[0,136]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYlZaWGRGSmhWVTVHWVZaa1YyUklaRmxhYXpGUVV6RldiV05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYlZaWGRGSmhWVTVHWVZaa1YyUklaRmxhYXpGUVV6RldiV05JWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14776789018830528976/customers/re